# Vendored third-party assets are stored byte-for-byte exactly as published, so their
# upstream SRI digests stay verifiable (see DESIGN.md section 3). core.autocrlf is true on
# Ken's machine and would otherwise rewrite line endings: leaflet.css ships CRLF upstream and
# leaflet.js ships LF, so both would drift from their published hashes on a checkout round trip.
vendor/** -text
